- Adjusts empty-state detection to treat error-shaped responses (e.g., `{ error: "Unauthorized" }`) as an empty feed.
- Updates the feed’s data flattening / pagination calculations to be more defensive (intended), so unauthenticated users see the empty state instead of a runtime crash.



